{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 35, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "Here is a dialogue between two people, one is dressed up in a ball gown and the other is dressed down in sweats, going to a nightly event:\n\n\"I'm so excited for the masquerade ball tonight,\" said Sophia, adjusting her mask and twirling in front of the mirror. She was wearing a beautiful red ball gown that sparkled in the light.\n\n\"Me too,\" replied her friend, Alex, who was lounging on the couch in his worn-out sweats. \"I'm just not sure why I have to dress up. It's not like anyone will recognize us behind our masks.\"\n\nSophia turned to Alex, looking at him with a mixture of amusement and horror. \"You're not going to wear those... things, are you? We're going to a formal event, Alex.\"\n\nAlex shrugged. \"Why not? It's dark, and we'll be dancing. No one will notice what I'm wearing. Besides, I'm comfortable.\"\n\nSophia sighed and walked over to Alex. \"There are a few reasons why you should change,\" she said, holding up her hand and ticking off the reasons:\n* It's a formal event, and dressing up is a sign of respect for the hosts and the other guests.\n* You'll be more in the mood for the occasion if you're dressed up.\n* You might actually have more fun if you're not worried about standing out in your ratty old sweats.\n\nAlex raised an eyebrow. \"You're not going to let this go, are you?\"\n\nSophia smiled. \"No, I'm not. Come on, I'll help you pick out something suitable to wear.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "Here", "logprob": -0.2138405293226242}, {"token": " is", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.10020658373832703}, {"token": " dialogue", "logprob": -0.0005268854438327253}, {"token": " between", "logprob": -0.0024760086089372635}, {"token": " two", "logprob": -0.3133542835712433}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.18389958143234253}, {"token": " one", "logprob